WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:23.023
Jemima picked some herbs.

2
00:00:23.024 --> 00:00:26.945
"The dinner will be lovely," she said.

3
00:00:26.946 --> 00:00:30.211
Kep, the farm dog, looked up.

4
00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:34.255
"Dinner?" he said.

5
00:00:34.256 --> 00:00:41.153
Jemima told him about the nice gentleman.

6
00:00:41.154 --> 00:00:45.191
"What does he look like?" asked Kep.

7
00:00:45.192 --> 00:00:50.389
Jemima told him.

8
00:00:50.390 --> 00:00:53.831
"Where does he live?" asked Kep.

9
00:00:53.832 --> 00:00:58.701
Jemima told him that too.

10
00:00:58.702 --> 00:01:01.484
"Hmm," said Kep.

11
00:01:01.485 --> 00:01:09.609
Then he ran off.

12
00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:19.877
Jemima flew back to the forest.

13
00:01:19.878 --> 00:01:24.621
The gentleman was sniffing the air.

14
00:01:24.622 --> 00:01:30.091
He looked nervous.

15
00:01:30.092 --> 00:01:34.095
"I have herbs for our dinner!" Jemima said.

16
00:01:34.096 --> 00:01:37.224
The fox jumped. "Oh,

17
00:01:37.225 --> 00:01:45.112
it's you," he said. "Get

18
00:01:45.113 --> 00:01:47.676
inside now!" Jemima

19
00:01:47.677 --> 00:01:51.263
gasped. "My

20
00:01:51.264 --> 00:01:56.069
friend is mean today!" she thought. Jemima

21
00:01:56.070 --> 00:01:59.426
went into the shed. Suddenly—

22
00:01:59.427 --> 00:02:02.485
wham!

23
00:02:02.486 --> 00:02:05.026
The door slammed shut.

24
00:02:05.027 --> 00:02:11.564
Jemima heard barks, growls, and howls.

25
00:02:11.565 --> 00:02:15.008
"Oh dear," she said.

26
00:02:15.009 --> 00:02:17.615
"What's going on?"

27
00:02:17.616 --> 00:02:21.870
Soon it was quiet.

28
00:02:21.871 --> 00:02:28.820
Someone opened the door.

29
00:02:28.821 --> 00:02:35.924
It was Kep.

30
00:02:35.925 --> 00:02:39.181
Kep gave Jemima a bag.

31
00:02:39.182 --> 00:02:43.187
"Put your eggs inside," he said.

32
00:02:43.188 --> 00:02:57.186
The dog took Jemima home.

33
00:02:57.187 --> 00:03:09.030
She found a new hiding spot.

34
00:03:09.031 --> 00:03:19.400
Soon she hatched some ducklings!

